> Time Spent: 1 min

> Topic: Arrays

> Question Prompt: Given an array, find the first duplicate number. Do not modify the array.

> Examples

```
Given [4, 3, 4, 8, 5, 9]  Return 4
Given [4, 3, 4, 8, 5, 9, 5]  Return 5
```

> Solution

```
public class Code {
    public int firstDuplicate(int[] sequence) {
        Map<Integer, Integer> map = new HashMap();
        for (int i = 0; i < sequence.length; i++) {
            int curr = sequence[i];
            if (map.containsKey(curr)) {
                return curr;
            } else {
                map.put(curr, i);
            }
        }
        return -1;
    }
}
