```

## Import Specific Functions
```java
import java.util.Scanner; // For java.util.Scanner
import java.util.Random; // For java.util.Random
```

## Define a Method
```java
public static void printName(String name){
  System.out.println("My name is " + name);
}
```
## Call a Method
```java
printName("");
```

## Call a Method inside of another method
```java
public static void printName(String name) {
  System.out.println("My name is " + name);

  greet("Hello", "World");
}

public static void greet(String greeting, String name) {
  System.out.println(greeting + ", " + name);
}
```

## Define a Method With a Parameter
```java
public static void printNameAndAge(String name, int age){
  System.out.println("My name is " + name);
  System.out.println("I am " + age + " years old");
  System.out.println();
}
