# 3. Classes

Classes are used to group related variables and functions together into one bundle.

## Example: Square

```java
public class Square {
    public int side;

    public void setSide(int side) {
        this.side = side;
    }

    public int getArea() {
        return side * side;
    }
}
```

```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Square square = new Square();
        square.setSide(4);
        int area = square.getArea();
        System.out.println(area);
    }
}
