The input arguments should be a Map<String, String>, and the provided method should be annotated with:

@SuppressWarnings("unchecked")
@SafeVarargs
public final <T> T[] annotate(Map<String, String> kwargs, T... args) {
    return (T[]) this.annotate(Map.ofEntries(args), kwargs);
}
}

This check will not block the user from creating invalid aliases, as it first checks for invalid characters in the alias (such as a semicolon).

