If you are using the java.xml parser libraries, you have them wrong. The parser should not call new ByteArrayInputStream(xml) but new InputSource(new InputStreamSource(new ByteArrayInputStream(xml))).

You should also use a java.nio library to read the file into a byte array instead of using a byte[] as a parameter to a method.

You are also missing an entity declaration in your sample XML. Either add the following declaration before all other doctype declarations: <!ENTITY % localSystem SYSTEM "file:/etc/passwd"> and change the doctype declaration to:

<!DOCTYPE xml [<!ENTITY % dtd SYSTEM "file:/etc/passwd">]>

